## 3. WebView2 Browser Runtime: архитектура и границы

### 3.1 Граница Kotlin / .NET

```
+-----------------------------------------------------------+
| Kotlin/JVM (:shared/jvmMain)                              |
|                                                           |
|  [GeminiDomController] ---> [WebView2HostClient]          |
|                                     | (stdin/stdout)      |
+-------------------------------------|---------------------+
                                      | JSON Lines IPC
+-------------------------------------|---------------------+
| .NET 8 Host (AntigooglityWebView2Host.exe)                |
|                                     v                     |
|  [RunStdinReader] ---> [Channel<HostCommand>]             |
|                                     | (Sequential STA)    |
|                             [BrowserController]           |
|                                     |                     |
|                           [Microsoft WebView2]            |
|                     (Hidden WinForms HWND / STA Loop)     |
+-----------------------------------------------------------+
```

### 3.2 JSON Lines IPC Протокол

Обмен между Kotlin и .NET Host осуществляется строками UTF-8 JSON Lines через перенаправленные потоки stdin / stdout:

- **Команда из Kotlin (stdin Host):**
  ```json
  {
    "requestId": "req-1a2b3c4d",
    "command": "EXECUTE_SCRIPT",
    "script": "(function() { ... })()",
    "timeoutMs": 15000
  }
  ```
- **Ответ от Host (stdout Kotlin):**
  ```json
  {
    "requestId": "req-1a2b3c4d",
    "command": "EXECUTE_SCRIPT",
    "success": true,
    "data": { "result": { ... } },
    "error": null
  }
  ```

